WEBVTT

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.920
Sairenji!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.090
There's something I want to talk to you about.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.640
I was watching that day at Sainan Water Land,

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:42.850
where Rito-san tried to confess but failed.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:47.040
Even so, my feelings haven't changed.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:51.190
I never cared much about my position anyway.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.580
I don't mind if I'm second or third.

00:00:55.580 --> 00:01:00.400
I'm fine as long as Rito looks at me.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:08.580
But I wonder if I'd look more mature if I fixed my hair a little.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:14.360
I wonder what I should do...

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:19.930
I'm glad I could tell Lala how I really feel, but Haruna-chan...

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.510
I like you!

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:28.090
I managed to explain that declaration away by saying that I meant I liked the pool,

00:01:28.090 --> 00:01:30.680
but I wonder what they were really thinking.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:40.240
How many times have I failed at confessing by now?

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:44.930
Rito-san, thanks for tending to the plants again.

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.810
I have some tea prepared in the living room,

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:48.540
so would you like to take a break?

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.730
Sure.

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:51.040
Thanks, Momo.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:03.600
Huh?

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.790
Momo, did you change your hairstyle?

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:07.170
Yes!

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.190
Just a little.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.550
I guess it's pretty good.

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:11.650
That's it?!

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.610
I'll have some tea after I've watered the flowers over there as well.

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.270
I see...

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:23.080
I'm glad he noticed, but I guess I was expecting too much.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:36.950
