00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:36.950
<b>「Prologue</b>

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:36.950
<b>「Prologue</b>

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:36.950
<b>~Commence Project~」</b>

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:36.950
<b>~Commence Project~」</b>

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.840
Maybe it's hopeless after all.

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:45.470
This is a problem that comes even before we become lovers.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:51.310
Oh!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.070
Momo, did you change your hairstyle?

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.330
It looks great!

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:57.350
Onee-sama, you seem really excited.

00:02:57.350 --> 00:02:58.930
Hehe, you can tell?

00:02:58.930 --> 00:02:59.870
I guess I am.

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:06.230
Actually, Lala-sama has been in a good mood ever since Rito-dono confessed his love to her at the pool yesterday.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:08.750
No, stop that, Peke!

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.780
You can't tell people things like that so carelessly.

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:12.870
Uh, um, really?

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:14.390
I'm sorry.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:17.310
But Rito-san was confessing to Haruna-san...

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:19.680
Eh, Momo, you knew?

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:24.820
The truth is Rito likes me,

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:27.940
but he has liked Haruna for much longer.

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:29.090
I see.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:31.860
But is that really something to be happy about?

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:32.690
Of course!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:38.830
Because then Haruna, Rito and I can all get married and we can all live happily ever after, right?

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.810
If Rito becomes the king of Deviluke,

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:43.110
Earth customs won't matter.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:46.170
And Haruna, too.

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:49.700
She's liked Rito for a long time.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:54.790
So I'm going to root for Haruna and Rito to get together from now on.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.720
But you can't tell anybody about this!

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:05.470
I'm sure both Rito and Haruna want to hear it from each other.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.180
What a great sister.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.940
She's so pure and positive, no matter what.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:18.480
I guess it's true that concubines aren't really unusual in any country.

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:23.830
My dad, the current Deviluke king, doesn't have any,

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.990
but he's an exception.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.210
If Rito-san becomes the king of Deviluke and has concubines,

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:33.530
he'll be able to share his love with many girls at the same time.

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:35.980
And if I'm included,

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:38.880
I can also receive an equal share of Rito's love!

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.060
That's it!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.890
That's the goal I will work for!

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:47.100
But taking Rito-san's personality into account,

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:49.260
this is easier said than done.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:53.220
I'm sure when he confessed to Onee-sama,

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:56.520
it was his way of sorting everything out after so long.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:00.610
I need to free us from the confines of Earth's customs.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.110
And for that, I have to...

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:05.650
Geez, that Rito...

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:10.490
Saying such confusing things...

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:22.500
Like he likes...

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:23.880
Nana!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.760
Ah! What is it?

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.000
You surprised me!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.220
Why don't we transfer to Sainan High School?

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:35.980
First I have to get in touch with all the girls around Rito-san.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.530
Come on, Maron, stay still.

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:45.980
It's been a while, so I need to wash you thoroughly.

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:52.700
I wonder what Yuuki-kun was trying to say at the pool.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.300
Ah!

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:01.750
It's bothering me, Maron!

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:09.060
I guess it's about time I put away the tube that Yuuki-kun blew up for me.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.830
Yui, do you know where the nail clipper is?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.650
Knock, Onii-chan!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.070
That's not all.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:34.240
The most important part is...

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:40.960
...the change in Rito-san's personality.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:13.990
I wonder what I'm going to do from now on.

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.580
Rito-san, Onee-sama and I...

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.460
No...

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:28.400
For all of us to be happy...

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:34.240
If I really got together with both of them like Lala was saying...

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:36.180
That sounds too good to be true.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.890
I will make it happen!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.150
Rito-san's harem!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.970
Is that right?

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:09.040
I don't think so.

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:45.540
Is something wrong, Celine?

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:03.800
