00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:03.800
<b>「Pollen plan</b>

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:03.800
<b>「Pollen plan</b>

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:03.800
<b>~Dangerous Little Sister~」</b>

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:03.800
<b>~Dangerous Little Sister~」</b>

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.110
What happened?!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.610
Celine?

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.590
You got drunk on cola again?

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:16.630
Sorry.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:20.110
I left an open bottle in the fridge.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:23.020
Let's have her lie down on a bed for now.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:25.330
If she gets her pollen on anyone, we're going to be in trouble-

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:36.590
Mikan, that flower!

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.220
That's bad, no way.

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.100
Rito...

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:47.450
Why are you all flustered?

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:50.980
Did you think I was going to throw myself on you?

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.630
Are you really okay?

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:55.990
Of course.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.190
I'm busy. Leave me alone.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.210
That's weird.

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:07.030
Do some people have immunity?

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.000
Thank goodness.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:23.770
What's this?!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:26.270
Rito's voice, his face...

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:29.060
My heart won't stop beating!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.750
I've heard about this.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:34.270
I didn't think Celine's pollen would be this bad.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:37.220
T-This could be trouble...

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.920
She's fast asleep.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:53.750
Ah, really?!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.250
Wow, that looks really appetising.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.620
Sensei, what happens next?

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:03.650
Well, take a look over here.

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:07.020
Daikon, tofu...

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.460
Sensei, what's this?

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.920
That looks delicious!

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.420
Let's make it for Rito next time!

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:15.980
I appreciate the thought,

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:19.480
but spare me the dark matter.

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.650
My body is hot.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:27.340
I can't look straight at Rito.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:31.080
Ah, Mikan, can you give me my cell phone?

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:34.670
Thanks.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:43.930
I just touched his hand a little... why am I so...

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:50.800
What's wrong?

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.870
Nothing!

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:10.270
Celine's pollen is really bad.

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:14.330
I need to stay away from Rito until this flower comes off.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.840
Mikan.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.610
What is it?

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:22.260
Do you know where the toilet cleaner we bought the other day is?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:23.620
Ah!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.210
It's under the sink.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.200
I see. I got it.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:31.980
Oh no!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.110
I tripped!

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.020
Are you all right?

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.940
I-I'm fine!

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:51.330
I'm sorry Mikan-san, I was spacing out.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.620
Did she do that on purpose?

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.700
I have to be more careful.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:10.240
Momo-san's probably planning something else.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:13.560
Mikan-san.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.190
Why are you panicking?

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.850
I'm not panicking at all!

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:21.690
Really?

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.440
So I suppose there's no problem.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:30.860
If there's anything troubling you, feel free to talk to me about it.

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:34.330
Suspicious!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.900
Beyond suspicious!

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.510
But that girl...

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:49.490
She saved Yami-san and me when we were in a bind.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:54.540
She might actually be worried about me.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:55.520
Mikan.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.690
I heard from Momo that you aren't feeling well.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.020
That woman!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.110
Now that she mentions it, your face is really red.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:04.340
Maybe you have a fever.

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.820
Eh, ah... I-I'm fine!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.730
Even though you said the pollen has no effect on you,

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:12.620
you still have a flower...

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.800
H-Hold on!

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:27.590
Mm... You don't seem to have a fever.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:32.180
You idiot, why would you measure my temperature like that at a time like this!

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.420
I...

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:50.460
I'm going crazy!

00:14:58.340 --> 00:14:59.250
Rito.

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:06.550
Hey, Mikan!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:07.420
Rito.

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:09.210
Rito...

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.240
Rito!

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:11.500
Hold on...

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:12.710
Rito!

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:14.350
Rito!

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:16.120
Rito!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.100
Rito!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:18.670
Hey, what's up?

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:19.520
Rito!

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.230
Mikan!

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:24.060
Rito!

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.750
Rito!

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.460
Onii-chan...

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.810
Are you...

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:01.310
...after all...

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:08.860
I...

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.480
...don't care anymore.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.830
I can't!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.900
I can't believe it!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.780
She resisted in that situation?!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.800
I guess her heart wasn't ready for it.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:17:00.180
I need to make her more honest with her real feelings.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:08.600
Mikan-san, I'll have you added to Rito-san's harem soon enough.

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:34.530
Ah, it came off.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:47.360
