00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:47.360
<b>「Body touch?</b>

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:47.360
<b>「Body touch?</b>

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:47.360
<b>~MEOWnderful Life~」</b>

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:47.360
<b>~MEOWnderful Life~」</b>

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.170
That restaurant was delicious.

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.800
I'm so full!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:00.180
No one is noticing me.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:01.720
What should I do?

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:05.120
I didn't think it'd turn out like this.

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:11.720
~10 Minutes ago~

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.210
Lala-san, is that a new invention?

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:13.690
That's right.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:17.070
It's an item that can turn you into an animal!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:21.600
I was thinking of giving it to Nana as a present when it's done.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:25.160
But somehow, I just can't get the settings right.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.600
No!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:30.580
A dog is chasing me!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:31.650
Oshizu-chan!

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.420
Hold on!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.130
I'm coming to save you now!

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:36.760
Lala-san, this!

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:48.730
I can't believe that turned me into a cat.

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:51.560
Lala-san hasn't come back either.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.250
What should I do?

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:56.460
I don't think I'll stay like this forever, but...

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.120
Kotegawa-san?!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.870
What a cute cat!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.000
Here, kitty kitty!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:22.560
She hates me!

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:23.800
Why?!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:27.040
Ah, I'm a cat, so I can't speak!

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.890
What do I do?

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:29.810
Ah, I got it!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.540
Thanks, Celine.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:46.740
Thank you.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:50.230
A cat?

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:02.510
Nana-chan can talk to animals, so if I find her...

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:05.460
I'm sorry for entering without permission.

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.340
Nana-chan, where are you?

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:08.680
Hmm? What is it?

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.350
A cat?

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.440
Yuuki-kun?

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:16.430
You can't just go inside people's houses.

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.150
That's not it!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.900
I'm not a cat, Yuuki-kun!

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:24.320
Wow, you sure are cute.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.550
C-Cute?

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:30.790
Yuuki-kun said I'm cute!

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.430
There, there.

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:46.680
I'm so happy.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.090
If I can become Yuuki-kun's cat,

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.310
that's good enough for me...

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:55.640
No, no!

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.310
That's not good at all!

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:00.690
Hey!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:10.540
Goodness, you sure are clumsy.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.140
How is this happening?!

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:17.030
Stay still, you're all sticky.

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:20.880
Yuuki-kun's naked.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:22.760
I can't look.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.360
Well, just a peek...

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.260
No, I can't!

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:29.230
Is this all right?

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:32.040
I've never had a pet before.

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:33.770
Sorry.

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:36.270
It'll be over soon, so just hang in there a little longer.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:39.650
Yuuki-kun is gentle even with cats.

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:46.010
Now that I think about it, one time I turned into a dog and Haruna-chan washed me in the bath.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:49.160
That was a crazy experience.

00:21:59.030 --> 00:22:02.170
This is bad, Yuuki-kun!

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:11.290
Don't touch that spot with your hands!

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:36.910
No... No!

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:44.040
W-What should I do?!

00:22:44.040 --> 00:22:48.430
I'm being washed by a boy!

00:22:59.280 --> 00:23:00.260
What the...

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:03.110
Stop moving!

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:20.420
I'm back to normal!

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:29.670
Y-Yuuki-kun!

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:31.930
Hang in there! Yuuki-kun!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:33.110
Is something wrong, Rito?!

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:35.370
What was that noise just now-

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:40.630
H-Haruna-san, why...

00:23:40.630 --> 00:23:43.320
T-This isn't what you think, Mikan-chan!

00:23:43.320 --> 00:23:45.320
You see, the cat...

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:47.040
I don't see a cat anywhere.

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:48.410
That's not what I meant.

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:50.400
I became a cat...

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:52.620
Looks like I missed out on a delicious scene.

00:23:57.670 --> 00:23:58.750
Huh?

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.920
Where did you go, Haruna?
